dram - LITEX setting to build the dram package.
eth - LITEX setting to build the ethernet package.
iclink - LITEX setting to build the iclink package.
litehyperbus - LITEX setting to build the litehyperbus package.
pcie - LITEX setting to build the pcie package.
sata - LITEX setting to build the sata package.
scope - LITEX setting to build the oscilloscope package.
sdcard - LITEX setting to build the sdcard package.
